Generated --> JSON[JSON Validation]

JSON --> Schema[Schema Validation]

Schema --> Injection[Prompt Injection Detection]

Injection --> Hallucination[Hallucination Detection]

Hallucination --> ResumeIntegrity[Resume Integrity Validation]

ResumeIntegrity --> PII[PII / Secret Scan]

PII --> ATSValid[ATS Formatting Validation]

ATSValid --> LaTeX[LaTeX Safety Validation]

LaTeX --> Decision{Valid?}

